OL,3,AIsraeli forces kill Palestinian boy in
OL,4,AWest Bank, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli forces have shot dead a
OL,7,F14-year-old Palestinian boy during an
OL,8,Foperation in the occupied West Bank,
OL,9,FPalestinian officials say.
OL,11,FMoataz Daghlas was killed on Monday
OL,12,Fevening in the village of Burqa,
OL,13,Fnorth-west of Nablus, according to the
OL,14,FPalestinian health ministry.
OL,16,FThe Israeli military said soldiers
OL,17,Fidentified "several terrorists who
OL,18,Fintended to hurl stones" in an area
OL,19,Fwhere stones had previously been thrown
OL,20,Fat Israeli vehicles. The soldiers fired
OL,21,Ftowards them "to remove the threat", it
OL,22,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
