OL,3,AIsraeli forces kill Palestinian boy in
OL,4,AWest Bank, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Palestinian Red Crescent said its
OL,7,Fteams treated two people with gunshot
OL,8,Fwounds, but that Israeli forces blocked
OL,9,Ftheir access to a third wounded person
OL,10,Fand detained three volunteer
OL,11,Fparamedics.
